Integration window: Peak boundaries found by walking left/right from apex until intensity falls below
  max(3% of apex, 3× noise estimate, 10th percentile) or a valley (neighboring peak). Then expanded via
  log-space noise threshold for HDX tails.
Collection window: Integration window + extension each side; extension = max(30s, 50% of integration width).
Peak drift buffer: Fixed +30 seconds on each side of the collection window.
Does NOT reject for envelope—computes envelope_ok and m0_gt_m1_gt_m2 for Step 7.
